translate deutsch b2c10s02_rh_party_e5e19a67:



    # "Ronja steers you towards a distinguished-looking man in his late 40s, his salt-and-pepper hair perfectly coiffed."

    "Ronja steuert Sie zu einem angesehenen Mann in seinen späten 40ern, dessen Salz-und-Pfeffer-Haare perfekt gerafft sind."


